   "text": "DOOR 1: the producer-side doorman\n\nStreet entrance, works ONE SHIFT\nGives ticket numbers in order: 1, 2, 3 ...\nSees \"number 7 again\"? Waves it off.\nRemembers only the LAST FEW numbers\nand only THIS shift",
