   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why the broker lets it in\n\nThe second send() is a brand new record\nwith a NEW sequence number (or a\ndifferent PID if another instance\nhandled it).",
   "originalText": "Why the broker lets it in\n\nThe second send() is a brand new record\nwith a NEW sequence number (or a\ndifferent PID if another instance\nhandled it).",
