   "text": "It identifies batches by SEQUENCE,\nnever by BUSINESS ID.\nIt cannot know they are \"the same\nevent\".",
   "originalText": "It identifies batches by SEQUENCE,\nnever by BUSINESS ID.\nIt cannot know they are \"the same\nevent\".",
