   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The producer column has ONE check, the API key covers the edge (and is bounded by its key window),\nthe consumer column is checked on EVERY row. That is why the consumer is the guarantee.",
   "originalText": "The producer column has ONE check, the API key covers the edge (and is bounded by its key window),\nthe consumer column is checked on EVERY row. That is why the consumer is the guarantee.",
