   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "7. Keep chunks BOUNDED: a big transaction holds locks and delays commit; a crash redoes\n   the whole chunk (bigger duplicate burst). Balance throughput vs reprocessing cost.",
   "originalText": "7. Keep chunks BOUNDED: a big transaction holds locks and delays commit; a crash redoes\n   the whole chunk (bigger duplicate burst). Balance throughput vs reprocessing cost.",
