   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. No separate \"does it exist?\" query: that would be a check-then-act RACE.\n2. Constraint on the right columns: (event_id) is globally unique today; if tenancy joins the\n   key it must be (tenant_id, event_id) and the lookup scope must match, or one tenant can\n   mask another's event.",
   "originalText": "1. No separate \"does it exist?\" query: that would be a check-then-act RACE.\n2. Constraint on the right columns: (event_id) is globally unique today; if tenancy joins the\n   key it must be (tenant_id, event_id) and the lookup scope must match, or one tenant can\n   mask another's event.",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
