   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "3. DO NOTHING keeps the FIRST version (right for immutable facts). DO UPDATE +\n   version guard only when a later version should replace an earlier one. Choose deliberately.\n5. Same id, different content? DO NOTHING would hide it: compare payload hashes / check\n   periodically (S3-F1: API returns 422; the sink may log).",
   "originalText": "3. DO NOTHING keeps the FIRST version (right for immutable facts). DO UPDATE +\n   version guard only when a later version should replace an earlier one. Choose deliberately.\n5. Same id, different content? DO NOTHING would hide it: compare payload hashes / check\n   periodically (S3-F1: API returns 422; the sink may log).",
